Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,H_en,,0,0,0,,"Step back. You're standing on my BLOOD PIT." She came to cancel the wedding.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.84,S_en,,0,0,0,,Today, HE dares to break the engagement first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.90,S_en,,0,0,0,,Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,You're standing on my blood pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:04.82,S_en,,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.93,S_en,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:09.98,S_en,,0,0,0,,Today I'm here to end this engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.37,S_en,,0,0,0,,My Yun family chose you as a scholar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:13.77,S_en,,0,0,0,,and reluctantly settled this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.71,S_en,,0,0,0,,And now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:15.81,S_en,,0,0,0,,You're so poor you boil stones to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:16.97,S_en,,0,0,0,,yet you're digging your own grave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:17.91,S_en,,0,0,0,,If word got out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.09,S_en,,0,0,0,,you'd shame my Yun family completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.03,S_en,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:21.01,S_en,,0,0,0,,A toad dreaming of swan meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.33,S_en,,0,0,0,,A penniless wretch like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.41,S_en,,0,0,0,,doesn't deserve a treasure like Yun Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:26.72,S_en,,0,0,0,,Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.20,S_en,,0,0,0,,why waste anger on this trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,It'd dirty your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.28,S_en,,0,0,0,,In cold like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.80,S_en,,0,0,0,,only my mansion in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,can give you true warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.16,S_en,,0,0,0,,My He family's cellar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.40,S_en,,0,0,0,,is stocked with coal enough to burn all winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:37.40,S_en,,0,0,0,,Move in,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.44,S_en,,0,0,0,,and even if the sky falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.04,S_en,,0,0,0,,not one of your fingers will freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:42.70,S_en,,0,0,0,,Throw the marriage paper over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:43.86,S_en,,0,0,0,,Then you can all get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.78,S_en,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.72,S_en,,0,0,0,,I said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.90,S_en,,0,0,0,,throw the marriage paper over.
